Conversation status panel shell, mini/panel/auto modes, Todo focus window,
background-work and child-session sections are adapted from
packages/ui/src/v4/ConversationStatusPanel.tsx, conversationStatusPanelModel.ts
and conversationLayout.ts of ZCode, revision
3c5b227649371507ddc4eb46ac5133afe6db1cab, Apache-2.0.
The host supplies committed activity facts, Git observations and navigation
actions; this independent component carries no execution authority.

src/explore-tool-call.mjs adapts packages/ui/src/lib/exploreToolCall.ts from
ZCode revision 3c5b227649371507ddc4eb46ac5133afe6db1cab, Apache-2.0. The copied
presentation classifier retains its command extraction and Explore/Execute
rules, with TypeScript erased and application identity imports replaced by
the independent tool identity registry. It never decides execution permissions.
The stage grouping defaults and Explore count buckets in activity-groups.mjs
follow that revision's v4/conversationAssistantWorkItems.ts and
ToolCallBlocks/renderers/explore.tsx.
